Battlefield losses mounting and a  Ukrainian counter-offensive advancing  Russian President Vladimir Putin says  now is the time to mobilize more troops  to protect our motherland its  sovereignty and territorial Integrity to  ensure the security of our nation and  people in the liberated areas I consider  it necessary to call for a partial  mobilization in Russia  the defense minister says as many as 300  000 Russian reservists will report for  Duty immediately but more could be  called up if necessary Putin also  confirmed that he would push ahead with  a referendum in four regions of Ukraine  including the donbass the referendum  will ask one question do you want to  join the Russian Federation that  referendum often a precursor to full  annexation of territory could happen as  early as this week President Vladimir  zielinski urged allies to focus on what  is important for Ukraine  more support for the Armed Forces for  intelligent services for the special  operations and security service for the  National Guard police and the Border  guards for everyone who is gradually  restoring our territorial Integrity  Western allies have said they will not  recognize a russian-led referendum or  annexation of Ukrainian territories  calling it illegal some analysts call a  referendum a predetermined sham and a  desperate Ploy by Putin there is no free  media to to talk about the issue there  is no election observers there is no  fair counting etc etc even without  talking about all illegality of the  thing because it's a down in violation  of Ukrainian and international law but  in his speech Putin left little doubt he  is ready to escalate this war  Russia has a variety of weapons of  Destruction some more modern than those  in NATO countries  and if our territorial Integrity is  threatened we will use all the means at  our disposal to protect Russia and our  people this is not a bluff  it's unclear if moving more troops to  the front lines and annexing Ukrainian  territory will be enough to turn the  tide in an operation that hasn't gone  according to Putin's plan what is clear  is this war is changing and potentially  entering a new even more dangerous phase  Gabriel ozando Al Jazeera Kiev
 

